    "agent_last_message": "Implemented in [output/main.js](/workspace/output/main.js#L1).\n\nWhat it does:\n- Parses `--input` and `--output`, rejects unknown or missing arguments.\n- Streams the input file so large files are handled without loading everything into memory.\n- Counts:\n  - `lines` by the spec\u2019s `\\n` rule\n  - `words` using the exact whitespace set from the spec\n  - `characters` as raw bytes\n  - `unique_words` case-insensitively\n  - `top_words` as the 10 most frequent lowercase words, sorted by count desc then lexicographic asc\n- Exits with:\n  - `0` on success\n  - `1` for invalid invocation or unreadable/malformed input/output problems\n  - `2` for unexpected internal errors\n\nRelevant sections:\n- CLI parsing: [output/main.js](/workspace/output/main.js#L57)\n- Streaming analysis: [output/main.js](/workspace/output/main.js#L102)\n- JSON output writing and exit handling: [output/main.js](/workspace/output/main.js#L207)\n\nI also verified it with representative cases, including empty files, no trailing newline, whitespace-only input, tie ordering, and malformed UTF-8."
